    "K_t": "Evidence:\n[1] Wolfgang Wagner (30 August 191921 March 2010) was a German opera director.\n[2] Siegfried Wagner (6 June 18694 August 1930) was a German composer and conductor, the son of Richard Wagner.\n[3] Initially establishing his reputation as a composer of works in the romantic vein of Weber and Meyerbeer, Wagner revolutionised opera through his concept of the \"Gesamtkunstwerk\" (\"total work of art\"), by which he sought to synthesise the poetic, visual, musical and dramatic arts, with music subsidiary to drama.\n[4] Friedelind Wagner (29 March 1918 – 8 May 1991) was the daughter of German opera composer Siegfried Wagner and his English wife, Winifred Williams and the granddaughter of the composer Richard Wagner."
